&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior&amp;nbsp;Software Engineer on Prisma, you&#39;ll help build and grow the Modeling library from the ground up. You&#39;ll work on the graph rendering, layout, and interaction logic that lets users model business processes clearly and efficiently, even with large and complex data sets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who already use AI coding tools daily and know how to apply them to solve real engineering problems fast, not as a novelty, but as part of how they build production-quality software.&lt;/p&gt;
