&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Architect scalable automation solutions and solve complex integration challenges using patterns, governance, and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
