&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering&lt;strong&gt;, a related field, or equivalent experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+&lt;/strong&gt; years of experience in software development &lt;strong&gt;is required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong&gt;at least 1 of Apex, Java (Spring Boot, Hibernate), .NET frameworks (C#, ASP.NET Core), or a similar modern language&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with modern JavaScript front end development and frameworks is a strong plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of scripting languages such as Python, Bash, or PowerShell &lt;strong&gt;is a plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with RESTful APIs, web services, and databases (SQL Server, MySQL, or Oracle)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with version control tools like Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and teamwork abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
