&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Advanced Services is a multi-skilled global team responsible for value added services and product customization. Advanced Services works on customized solutions on NICE products for global customers.&amp;nbsp;You are joining as a core member of the Advanced Services development team. If you are passionate about great software development and care about the quality of your work, you should join our team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
