&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enabling engineering teams across Canonical to develop software with confidence by making distributed system testing tooling available across the company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Enhancing continuous integration pipelines for deploying and testing Canonical’s cloud native products such as Kubeflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
